r\u003e`, since git-issue's users are the closest to ours.\n\n**Honesty and process**\n- [ ] Credit git-bug in ADR 0004 and the Storage spec: our data model comes from it.\n- [ ] Add a \"Prior art\" section to the PRD template, so looking for prior art becomes a habit.\n- [ ] Fix the drift that ADRs 0003, 0004 and 0007 list under \"Left open\". The spec is the contract.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1794311873,"data":{"issue":"914641b07fef4fda5cc18be6f744878b147e3bb0","field":"status","value":"open"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1794311873,"data":{"issue":"914641b07fef4fda5cc18be6f744878b147e3bb0","field":"labels","value":""}}]}